  data: {
    LLM: "Hoard Queens of Spades and Jacks of Diamonds. The Double Bezique (500) is the game-winner. Do not waste them in tricks.\n\nStock Management: Keep track of how many cards are left. You want to win the LAST trick of Phase 1 to declare one final meld before the rules tighten.\n\nBreaking Melds: Sometimes you must play a component of a meld (e.g., an Ace from 4 Aces) to win a trick to declare a bigger meld (Sequence). It's a trade-off.",
